      "title": "메인 카피 후보 뽑기",
      "sourceUrl": "https://chatgpt.com/c/5d1e77b0-91a3-8004-c2e8-3b7f0d6a1e94",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-12T21:40:00+09:00",
